{
  "_review": [
    "Drafted 15 September 2026 from the five rate cards (Automation, Branding, Design, Development, Social media), each line filed under the closest of the twenty-two services. `group` is the rate-card heading it came from, so every line can be traced back. Correct the filing before --apply; a line under the wrong service inherits the wrong handover, completion and exclusions.",
    "Design card, Product & App (Mobile app UI, SaaS product design, dashboards): filed under 06 Custom web build with group 'Product & app'. None of the twenty-two is a product-design service; this group probably wants its own, cloned from 06.",
    "Design card, Retainership (Design support, Product design, Campaign, Motion, Brand consistency): filed under 15 Content production with group 'Design retainers'. A 'Design retainer' service may be wanted; UX Optimization Retainer went to 19.",
    "Development card, Retainership (SEO, Analytics monitoring, Performance monitoring, Technical support, Content/CMS management): filed under 18 Website maintenance. An 'SEO retainer' service may be wanted.",
    "AI chat and lead-qualification lines appear on both the Development card and the Automation card at different prices (AI Chat Assistant 45,000 vs Basic Chat Assistant 20,000; AI Lead Qualification 35,000 vs AI Lead Qualification Bot 25,000). Both are loaded under 13 with the card named in the group. Reconcile to one price or keep both as tiers.",
    "Social media card: 'Engagement (comments, replies - monthly)' appears twice, at 8,000 under Organic growth (filed 16) and 25,000 under Performance marketing (filed 17). Check which is meant.",
    "Design card: 'Spline Experience Design' is printed as 4,000, which looks like 40,000 beside its neighbours. Loaded as written.",
    "Retainer ranges (e.g. Website Maintenance 8,000 - 25,000) are loaded at the low end, with the range kept in the line's text.",
    "Multi-channel automation has a set-up column and a monthly column: the set-up fee is a fixed line under 12 Automation build, the monthly one a monthly line under 20 AI system operation."
  ],

